Subject: [PATCH 06/21] xgameruntime: Initialise the task queue deleting flags.

---
 dlls/xgameruntime/GDKComponent/System/Threading/XTaskQueue.h | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/dlls/xgameruntime/GDKComponent/System/Threading/XTaskQueue.h b/dlls/xgameruntime/GDKComponent/System/Threading/XTaskQueue.h
index 2c68e95..242b16c 100644
